  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You bury your enemy in crushing stone.</p><p>Choose a target within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. It must succeed on an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or become <strong>Incapacitated</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>If the target fails its opposed check, you may choose to inflict <strong>1 Damage</strong> at the start of the target's turn, as the stone attempts to crush them. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage </strong>by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the duration of the spell by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.ebmxpkQKp2fwvNRx]{Stone Coffin}</p>",
